=================================================================================
             FORM-MOLDED MONOLITHIC HOUSING PARADIGM (ACDelco Style)
=================================================================================

[ Enclosure Specs ]
- Geometry: Monolithic compression-molded casting (Die-Cast Aluminum Alloy).
- Interlocks: Zero snap-lock mechanisms. Outer mating walls use flat-flange 
  mating configurations requiring uniform bolt-torque patterns to secure.
- Mounting Points: Recessed counter-bored guide channels to guarantee alignment.

[ Gasket Compression Matrix ]
- Material: High-density fluorosilicone elastomer (Form-In-Place / Die-Cut Profile).
- Resistance: Petroleum fluid barrier, high-thermal threshold, shielding against 
  electromagnetic interference (EMI) across cross-domain routing circuits.
- Interface Seal: Flat elastomer tracks molded continuously directly into the bridge 
  chassis lip to remove shear gaps or structural shifting.
